OL,3,GNEWSADriver killed in two-car crash on
OL,4,AA94 in Angus is named
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver who died in a two-car crash in
OL,7,FAngus on Thursday has been named by
OL,8,Fpolice.
OL,10,FHe was 34-year-old Michael Cruickshank,
OL,11,Fwho lived in the Alyth area.
OL,13,FHe was driving a white Audi A1 when it
OL,14,Fwas involved in a crash with a
OL,15,Fdark-coloured Ford Focus on the A94
OL,16,Fnear Glamis.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
